{
  "name": "czx_talk_campaign",
  "description": "战役层事件台本：外交/领主/机制/经济/回合。channel 默认 event_feed，重要事件用 dilemma。",
  "scan_depth": 5, "token_budget": 200, "recursive_scanning": false, "extensions": {},
  "entries": [
    {
      "keys": ["peace_treaty"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "战火暂歇。{faction} 与 {target} 停火——纸上的和平，能不能撑过冬还两说。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["peace_treaty"], "secondary_keys": ["mannfred"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "和平？当然可以。曼弗雷德的耐心以百年计。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "mannfred", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["alliance_formed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "盟约已立：{faction} 与 {target} 共进退。信义值几个回合，战场上见。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["alliance_formed"], "secondary_keys": ["katarin"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "盟约如冰面——踩上去之前，先试试厚度。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "katarin", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["treaty_broken"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "撕毁盟约：{faction} 的单方面毁约已成事实。信任这种东西，碎一次就够了。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["treaty_broken"], "secondary_keys": ["skaven"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "背约？不不，是'战略修正'——鼠人的字典里没有背信这个词，yes-yes。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 75,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "cond": { "race": "skaven" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["treaty_broken"], "secondary_keys": ["dwarf"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "盟约即誓言。今日之毁约，已全文录入仇恨之书——红字。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 75,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "cond": { "race": "dwarf" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["vassalized"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 俯首称臣。旧世界又少了一面旗，多了一名家臣。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["confederation"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 并入 {target}。两姓归一旗——合邦从来不只是地图换色。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["confederation"], "secondary_keys": ["thorgrim"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "又一支氏族归卡拉克·安科旗下。誓言的账，簿上又厚一页。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "thorgrim", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["faction_destroyed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 已从地图上抹除。一个名字沉入史册——旧世界每天都有名字沉下去。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["faction_destroyed"], "secondary_keys": ["khorne"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 覆灭。颅座不在乎是谁的头——数到了就行。",
      "insertion_order": 75, "priority": 75,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true, "cond": { "race": "khorne_daemon" } } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["settlement_razed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{location} 被夷平。灰烬里只剩地基，和来不及带走的名字。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["settlement_sacked"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{location} 遭洗劫。金库见了底，粮仓见了底，人心也是。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["siege_started"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "围城开始：{location} 城门紧闭。守军的耐心，正在被一勺一勺舀走。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 55,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["siege_lifted"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{location} 解围。城墙还在，人心也还在——这次算赢了半座城。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 55,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["army_destroyed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 一支满编被成建制歼灭。募兵官的墨还没干，就得重新开册。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_died"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "领主 {lord} 陨落于 {location}。旧世界又少了一个能被人记住的名字。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_died"], "secondary_keys": ["thorgrim"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "一位仇敌落幕。仇恨之书上划掉一个名字——划掉的恨不算恨，算史书。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "thorgrim", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_wounded"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{lord} 重伤被抬回大营。恢复需要时间——而敌人不给时间。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 55,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["lord_recruited"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "新领主 {lord} 就位。履历是一张白纸，战场会替它写满。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 35,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["levelup"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{lord} 历经战阵，又进一步。名号这种东西，是拿胜仗喂出来的。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 35,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["levelup"], "secondary_keys": ["katarin"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "冰下之力又深一层。寒冬从不需要炫耀。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 75,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "katarin", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["quest_issued"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{lord} 领受了新的征程：{quest}。传说的开头，往往就是一张差事。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["quest_completed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{lord} 完成了 {quest}。从今天起，酒馆里的唱法又添一段。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["research_completed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "学问落地：{tech} 研究完成。图纸变成兵刃，只差炉火。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 40,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["building_completed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{location} 的 {building} 落成。砖瓦不说话，但城墙会。",
      "insertion_order": 110, "priority": 30,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["treasury_low"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "国库见底。士兵要饷、城要修、仗还要打——先从哪一笔省起？",
      "insertion_order": 95, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["rebellion"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{location} 民心沸反，叛乱将起。火还没点，烟已经呛人了。",
      "insertion_order": 90, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["chaos_rift"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "裂缝在 {region} 上空张开。风从那边吹过来——闻得到硫磺和谵语。",
      "insertion_order": 75, "priority": 75,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["plague_spread"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "瘟疫蔓延至 {region}。不是谁的阴谋——只是祖父的礼物又准时了一季。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["waaagh_called"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "WAAAGH 已起！绿潮开始往一个方向滚——谁都挡不住，包括他们自己。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["waaagh_called"], "secondary_keys": ["grimgor"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "小子们！跟上俺！WAAAGH！！",
      "insertion_order": 75, "priority": 85,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "grimgor", "channel": "dilemma" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["ritual_started"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 的大仪式启动。天地间的线，正在被谁一根根拨动。",
      "insertion_order": 80, "priority": 65,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["ritual_completed"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "{faction} 仪式完成。旧世界的棋盘上，又多了一颗别人看不见的子。",
      "insertion_order": 75, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["ambush_sprung"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "伏兵！林中杀声起——行军路线泄密了。",
      "insertion_order": 85, "priority": 60,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["attrition_warning"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "军队在损耗：饥饿、瘴气、冻土——没有刀光的仗最难打。",
      "insertion_order": 95, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["corruption_spread"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "腐化在 {region} 加深。井水是清的，但喝的人眼神不对了。",
      "insertion_order": 95, "priority": 55,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed", "template": true } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["turn_start"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "新的一回合。地图没变，局势变了——棋盘从不在意棋子怎么想。",
      "insertion_order": 120, "priority": 25,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["turn_start"], "secondary_keys": ["karl_franz"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "新的一日。奏报可以等，边境的烽火不能等。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "karl_franz", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["turn_start"], "secondary_keys": ["malekith"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "又一个千年里的一天。复仇不急——它从来不缺时间。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "malekith", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["turn_start"], "secondary_keys": ["settra"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "日出如旧。朕的帝国如旧。朕之耐心，亦如旧。",
      "insertion_order": 100, "priority": 70,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "settra", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["idle_banter"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "军中无事。士兵在赌骰子，军官在数补给——太平日子最贵的是耐心。",
      "insertion_order": 130, "priority": 10,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["idle_banter"], "secondary_keys": ["greasus"], "selective": true, "enabled": true,
      "content": "没仗打的日子里，只好多吃两顿。账照样记，肉照样炖。",
      "insertion_order": 110, "priority": 50,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "greasus", "channel": "event_feed" } }
    },
    {
      "keys": ["under_attack_report"], "enabled": true,
      "content": "我方 {location} 遭到攻击！烽烟已起，调兵还是弃守，即刻决断。",
      "insertion_order": 70, "priority": 80,
      "extensions": { "czx": { "kind": "line", "speaker": "narrator", "channel": "dilemma", "template": true } }
    }
  ]
}
